% SPDX-License-Identifier: EUPL-1.2
% =====================================================================
% parameters.clausal -- the PROVENANCE records of the sourced figures of
% eu/data_protection/gdpr_child_consent_age_fields. PROVENANCE ONLY: this file references each figure by
% name and holds no value, and the logic modules do not import it.
%
% parameters-sources.yaml is not a commissioning register (it lists no keys), so
% this file holds no parameter records. The figures 16 and 13 are integer constants in the
% slice that reads them, each carrying its Art 8(1) citation.
%
% Art 8(3) is a saving clause for the general contract law of Member States. No rule of
% this order reads it; it is recorded here as an excluded provision (never returned).
% =====================================================================

:- module(parameters, []).

excluded_provision(cite(eu_reg_2016_679_art_8_3)).

:- end_module(parameters).
